{
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
  "rate": "+8%",
  "frames": [
    {
      "id": "01-hook",
      "duration": 8.499,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "Your app emits events.",
          "src": "vo/01-hook-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 1.063
        },
        {
          "text": "The rest of your stack expects webhooks.",
          "src": "vo/01-hook-1.wav",
          "start": 1.733,
          "dur": 1.916
        },
        {
          "text": "Which means retries. Signing. Health checks. Every time.",
          "src": "vo/01-hook-2.wav",
          "start": 3.869,
          "dur": 3.73
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "02-pain",
      "duration": 13.718,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "So teams build it: a Redis queue, retry crons, signing code, dashboards, alerts.",
          "src": "vo/02-pain-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 5.558
        },
        {
          "text": "And events still quietly get lost.",
          "src": "vo/02-pain-1.wav",
          "start": 6.228,
          "dur": 1.954
        },
        {
          "text": "With Sparrow, it's just Postgres.",
          "src": "vo/02-pain-2.wav",
          "start": 8.401,
          "dur": 1.7
        },
        {
          "text": "Sparrow: webhook delivery you run yourself.",
          "src": "vo/02-pain-3.wav",
          "start": 10.321,
          "dur": 2.497
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03-three",
      "duration": 9.188,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "Let's follow one event, item.shipped, through three nights.",
          "src": "vo/03-three-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 3.283
        },
        {
          "text": "The happy path. The night the partner went dark. And the Tuesday you shipped a bug.",
          "src": "vo/03-three-1.wav",
          "start": 3.953,
          "dur": 4.335
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04-happy",
      "duration": 35.53,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "Night one. Your warehouse app pushes item.shipped: one POST.",
          "src": "vo/04-happy-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 3.801
        },
        {
          "text": "Sparrow stores it and answers in the same breath: 201, event ID.",
          "src": "vo/04-happy-1.wav",
          "start": 4.471,
          "dur": 4.431
        },
        {
          "text": "Same parcel pushed twice? Same idempotency key, same event, no duplicate.",
          "src": "vo/04-happy-2.wav",
          "start": 9.123,
          "dur": 5.37
        },
        {
          "text": "Then fan-out: every subscription that matches, by name, consumer, even labels like region=eu.",
          "src": "vo/04-happy-3.wav",
          "start": 14.713,
          "dur": 6.76
        },
        {
          "text": "For each match, one request: your envelope or your own template, secret headers encrypted at rest, any HTTP method.",
          "src": "vo/04-happy-4.wav",
          "start": 21.693,
          "dur": 8.296
        },
        {
          "text": "Signed, and out the door. Three parcels, three docks, three green ticks.",
          "src": "vo/04-happy-5.wav",
          "start": 30.208,
          "dur": 4.421
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05-verify",
      "duration": 13.833,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "On the other side, your customer checks the signature.",
          "src": "vo/05-verify-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 2.625
        },
        {
          "text": "One file to copy in: Python, TypeScript, Java, Ruby, and five more.",
          "src": "vo/05-verify-1.wav",
          "start": 3.295,
          "dur": 4.923
        },
        {
          "text": "Wrong key, replayed, or older than five minutes? Rejected at the door.",
          "src": "vo/05-verify-2.wav",
          "start": 8.438,
          "dur": 4.495
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06-night",
      "duration": 48.458,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "Night two. 3:12 a.m. The partner's dock is closed: 503.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 4.616
        },
        {
          "text": "Sparrow reads the answer. Server error? Worth another try. DNS, TLS, 4xx? It stops.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-1.wav",
          "start": 5.286,
          "dur": 6.869
        },
        {
          "text": "So it backs off: one minute, two, four, doubling, capped at a day.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-2.wav",
          "start": 12.375,
          "dur": 3.952
        },
        {
          "text": "A 429 with Retry-After? It waits exactly that long, and it doesn't count as an attempt.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-3.wav",
          "start": 16.547,
          "dur": 5.317
        },
        {
          "text": "Fail after fail, the webhook's health slides: healthy, degraded, unhealthy.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-4.wav",
          "start": 22.084,
          "dur": 4.845
        },
        {
          "text": "Five in a row, and your on-call gets an email. You? You're asleep.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-5.wav",
          "start": 27.149,
          "dur": 3.883
        },
        {
          "text": "6:40. The partner is back. Every failed delivery from tonight: one snapshot, one retry.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-6.wav",
          "start": 31.251,
          "dur": 6.112
        },
        {
          "text": "A snapshot, not a live query: what you saw is exactly what gets retried.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-7.wav",
          "start": 37.583,
          "dur": 4.6
        },
        {
          "text": "And every attempt is on record: status, timing, category. Nothing is a mystery.",
          "src": "vo/06-night-8.wav",
          "start": 42.403,
          "dur": 5.155
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "07-tuesday",
      "duration": 20.68,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "Night three. Tuesday's deploy put the wrong weight on every parcel.",
          "src": "vo/07-tuesday-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 3.89
        },
        {
          "text": "Fix the bug. Then re-push every item.shipped from Tuesday: one snapshot, one job.",
          "src": "vo/07-tuesday-1.wav",
          "start": 4.56,
          "dur": 5.737
        },
        {
          "text": "Partner mid-deploy? Pause their webhook. Deliveries wait. Resume when they're ready.",
          "src": "vo/07-tuesday-2.wav",
          "start": 10.517,
          "dur": 4.62
        },
        {
          "text": "And your customers watch all of it themselves, in a portal you hand them with one link.",
          "src": "vo/07-tuesday-3.wav",
          "start": 15.357,
          "dur": 4.423
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "08-recipes",
      "duration": 29.744,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "What goes out is yours to shape. A Go template turns the envelope into whatever the receiver expects.",
          "src": "vo/08-recipes-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 5.47
        },
        {
          "text": "Add your own headers, even an API token, encrypted at rest. Any method: POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE.",
          "src": "vo/08-recipes-1.wav",
          "start": 6.14,
          "dur": 6.899
        },
        {
          "text": "So one event can call almost any HTTP API, not just a webhook.",
          "src": "vo/08-recipes-2.wav",
          "start": 13.258,
          "dur": 4.428
        },
        {
          "text": "Recipes are those templates, pre-built: PagerDuty, Twilio, SendGrid, ClickHouse and more, one YAML file each.",
          "src": "vo/08-recipes-3.wav",
          "start": 17.907,
          "dur": 7.928
        },
        {
          "text": "One command: sparrow use pagerduty.",
          "src": "vo/08-recipes-4.wav",
          "start": 26.055,
          "dur": 2.788
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "09-seeing",
      "duration": 9.611,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "A dashboard ships inside the same binary: webhooks, events, deliveries, health.",
          "src": "vo/09-seeing-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 4.772
        },
        {
          "text": "And OpenTelemetry traces every parcel, push to dock.",
          "src": "vo/09-seeing-1.wav",
          "start": 5.442,
          "dur": 3.27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "10-needs",
      "duration": 11.603,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "So what does it need to run?",
          "src": "vo/10-needs-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 0.726
        },
        {
          "text": "Just PostgreSQL. The queue lives there too. No Redis, no broker.",
          "src": "vo/10-needs-1.wav",
          "start": 1.396,
          "dur": 4.257
        },
        {
          "text": "MIT licensed: free to run, fork and ship. No per-message pricing.",
          "src": "vo/10-needs-2.wav",
          "start": 5.873,
          "dur": 4.831
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "11-compare",
      "duration": 12.117,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "How does that stack up?",
          "src": "vo/11-compare-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 0.622
        },
        {
          "text": "Svix and Convoy add Redis. Hookdeck's core is SaaS.",
          "src": "vo/11-compare-1.wav",
          "start": 1.292,
          "dur": 3.865
        },
        {
          "text": "Sparrow is fully MIT, with dual signing, recipes, a portal and self-monitoring.",
          "src": "vo/11-compare-2.wav",
          "start": 5.378,
          "dur": 5.84
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "12-takeaway",
      "duration": 8.597,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "So, where did item.shipped end up?",
          "src": "vo/12-takeaway-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 1.861
        },
        {
          "text": "Every dock. Every time. Even the nights you slept.",
          "src": "vo/12-takeaway-1.wav",
          "start": 2.531,
          "dur": 2.918
        },
        {
          "text": "Push once. Sparrow does the rest.",
          "src": "vo/12-takeaway-2.wav",
          "start": 5.669,
          "dur": 2.028
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13-cta",
      "duration": 5.448,
      "cues": [
        {
          "text": "One Go binary. One Postgres.",
          "src": "vo/13-cta-0.wav",
          "start": 0.45,
          "dur": 2.02
        },
        {
          "text": "docker compose up, and you're delivering.",
          "src": "vo/13-cta-1.wav",
          "start": 2.69,
          "dur": 1.858
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
